# Proposed UI-Only Structure (Next.js App Router + Tailwind v4)

```
app-next-directory/
├─ app/
│  ├─ layout.tsx                // root layout, imports globals.css, renders <Header/><Footer/>
│  ├─ globals.css               // Tailwind v4 base + light resets
│  ├─ page.tsx                  // Home: uses <FeaturedListingsSection/> + <CityCarouselSection/>
│  ├─ listings/
│  │  └─ [slug]/page.tsx        // ListingDetail page (UI composition)
│  ├─ city/
│  │  └─ [slug]/page.tsx        // CityDetail page (UI composition with ListingGrid)
│  └─ search/
│     └─ page.tsx               // Advanced search (query + multi-filters + results + auto-redirect)
│
├─ src/components/
│  ├─ layout/
│  │  ├─ Header.tsx
│  │  └─ Footer.tsx
│  ├─ cards/
│  │  ├─ ListingCard.tsx        // REUSE (ensure href=/listings/[slug])
│  │  └─ CityCard.tsx           // NEW (links to /city/[slug])
│  ├─ sections/
│  │  ├─ FeaturedListingsSection.tsx   // NEW (uses ListingGrid)
│  │  └─ CityCarouselSection.tsx       // NEW (horizontal scroll or Embla later)
│  ├─ listings/
│  │  └─ ListingGrid.tsx        // REUSE for all grids (home, city page, search)
