### Why this shape?

* Keeps **cards/grids** reusable across Featured, City Detail, and Search (your `ListingCard`/`ListingGrid` already exist and are close to ready) .
* Pushes **page composition** and **routing** into `app/…/page.tsx` files so navigation is consistent (slug/city slugs come from your existing types/queries). Your types already include `AppListingCard` and city shapes that fit this nicely. &#x20;

